      "text": "Paul Nicholls (actor)\nPaul Nicholls ( born Paul Greenhalgh on 12 April 1979 ) is an English actor from Bolton , Greater Manchester , England . He is best known for his roles as Joe Wicks in BBC 's EastEnders , and as DS Sam Casey in ITV 's Law & Order : UK ."
