    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 646,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Law & Order: UK (series 8)\nOn 28 June 2013 , Bradley Walsh stated on This Morning that Law & Order : UK would return with an eighth series , commissioned to start filming in October 2013 . In September 2013 , broadcaster ITV confirmed that Law & Order : UK would return in 2014 with an eight episode series , and that Ben Bailey Smith had been cast as DS Joe Hawkins , replacing Paul Nicholls as DS Sam Casey . This was the last series of Law & Order : UK '' to air , with broadcaster ITV and producer Kudos issuing a joint press release , on 3 June 2014 , announcing that it would be `` the last to be transmitted for the foreseeable future '' ."
     }
    ],
